<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-11079] MVCC: IgniteCacheContinuousQueryBackupQueueTest is flacky.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11079</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;See Tc run&lt;br/&gt;
 &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/project.html?projectId=IgniteTests24Java8&amp;amp;testNameId=925274886589214180&amp;amp;tab=testDetails&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/project.html?projectId=IgniteTests24Java8&amp;amp;testNameId=925274886589214180&amp;amp;tab=testDetails&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test fails after series of long JVM pauses with stacktrace:&lt;/p&gt;
