                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16786965" author="rkondakov" created="Thu, 7 Mar 2019 16:38:51 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Dedicated TC run for this test: &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewType.html?buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_MvccQueries&amp;amp;tab=buildTypeStatusDiv&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=pull%2F6249%2Fhead&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewType.html?buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_MvccQueries&amp;amp;tab=buildTypeStatusDiv&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=pull%2F6249%2Fhead&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16790866" author="rkondakov" created="Tue, 12 Mar 2019 18:43:10 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Problem: The problem was that &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/gridgain/apache-ignite/commit/42293fac88c29544b7c55c0340224afbf474a301&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;implemented optimization&lt;/a&gt; of storing filtered events in the backup queues was not taken into account for this test. After this optimization backups do not store all filtered events and instead storing they use&#160;&lt;tt&gt;filtered&lt;/tt&gt; counter. In this case the expectation of the large size of backup queues is wrong.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Fix: fixed the expectation of backup queues total size - it should be small or even zero.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;Since the only test code was changed, the RunAll visa from the TC Bot is not necessary. I&apos;ve runned two relevant suites (mvcc and non-mvcc). Waiting for results:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewQueued.html?itemId=3299122&amp;amp;tab=queuedBuildOverviewTab&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewQueued.html?itemId=3299122&amp;amp;tab=queuedBuildOverviewTab&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewQueued.html?itemId=3299120&amp;amp;tab=queuedBuildOverviewTab&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewQueued.html?itemId=3299120&amp;amp;tab=queuedBuildOverviewTab&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16791417" author="rkondakov" created="Wed, 13 Mar 2019 07:48:16 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=amashenkov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;amashenkov&quot;&gt;amashenkov&lt;/a&gt;, tests are OK. Patch is ready for review.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16791530" author="amashenkov" created="Wed, 13 Mar 2019 10:03:16 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merged to master.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thank for contribution.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
